@startuml 03-arquitectura-local
title Arquitectura local de IntenCite

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 45

actor "Usuario" as User

rectangle "Docker Compose\nIntenCite" as Docker {

    node "intencite-gateway\nNginx :8080" as Gateway

    node "intencite-app" as App {
        component "Nginx\nFrontend estático\nPuerto 80" as Nginx
    }

    node "intencite-api" as Api {
        component "FastAPI + Uvicorn\nPuerto 8001" as FastAPI

        artifact "TF-IDF +\nLogistic Regression" as Baseline

        artifact "Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n+ LoRA adapter" as Qwen
    }
}

User --> Gateway : http://localhost:8080

Gateway --> Nginx : /\nArchivos estáticos
Gateway --> FastAPI : /api/*\n/health

User ..> FastAPI : http://localhost:8001\nAcceso directo / Swagger

FastAPI --> Baseline : Inferencia clásica
FastAPI --> Qwen : Inferencia LoRA\nKV cache

note bottom of Gateway
El gateway Nginx local reproduce
el enrutamiento realizado por
el Application Load Balancer en AWS.
end note

note bottom of Nginx
El frontend tiene la misma
responsabilidad en local y AWS:
servir archivos estáticos.
end note

@enduml